usage: issue43-runs.py [-h] [--run-id RUN_ID]

Preserve all related workflow logs, metadata and check annotations
sequentially. Usage: python experiments/issue43-runs.py Unfinished runs retain
metadata and are collected on the next invocation. Use repeatable --run-id to
refresh only selected runs after the full collection.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --run-id RUN_ID
